# Auto-deploy to Vercel

For the `influencer-platform` project, after finishing user-facing or API code changes that should go live:

1. Deploy to production without waiting to be asked: `cd influencer-platform && vercel --prod --yes`
2. Confirm the deploy succeeded and share the production URL in the reply
3. Do this even when the folder is not a git repo (this project often deploys via Vercel CLI only)

Skip auto-deploy only for:

- Docs-only, canvas-only, or local-script work that does not affect the Next.js app
- Failed builds / when the user explicitly says not to deploy
- Pure questions with no code changes

When in doubt for app code in this project: deploy.
